{"parse": {"title": "LEE-10", "pageid": 88303, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-09\" title=\"LEE-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LEE-10</span><a href=\"/wiki/LEE-11\" title=\"LEE-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LEE</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">10</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B8.80.E9.9D.A2.E5.8F.88.E4.B8.80.E9.9D.A2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"一面又一面\">一面又一面</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 一面又一面</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Piracy—Not the Fun Kind.</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>噢<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>对<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>唱<span class=\"color-value\"></span>片<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>坏<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>响<span class=\"color-value\"></span>远<span class=\"color-value\"></span>甚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>磁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>带<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2410110</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>希曼的发言显然是颗更重磅的炸弹。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\"><img alt=\"2_4_b2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6c/Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_lapulasihuiyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅰ：</div><div>希曼女士，我没听错吧……您刚才提到了基金会？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅰ：</div><div>据我所知，这次会议需要解决的是如何确认能够越过“暴雨”的稳定性材料，这跟基金会有什么关系？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>——天大的好消息！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>你们赶走了铁壳子，现在这儿得轮到基金会的呆脑瓜们拍板了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>首先，我完全不接受基金会对于拉普拉斯科算中心的一丁点儿管辖权，我会在之后解决这个问题的，我保证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>心怀愤懑的会议主持人高举手掌，片刻后又无奈放下，只能颓然坐倒在椅子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>其次，你可以开始宣布了，希曼女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>我理解你的心情，哑谜先生。但就眼下的状况而言，这不见得是一件坏事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她展开了一份工整的文书。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>基金会的决议主要是关于“人工暴雨”项目的，乌尔里希先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/HeadIconSmall-520801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅱ：</div><div>你背叛了组织，乌尔里希？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>该死的，我没有——！我只是想要一份基金会仓库的通行证。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>基金会答应了你的援助申请。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>实验清单里提及的大部分材料、非对称核素R的储量补充、协助实验的外派调查员，一切都将分批运送到拉普拉斯的各分部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>另外，关于你提到的符合实验条件的坐标，基金会同样做了初步筛选与确认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"516501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"516501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/29/HeadIconSmall-516501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-516501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">与会人员Ⅰ：</div><div>……基金会之前可从没对我们这么大方过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>幸福来得太过突然，连久经战场的组长也恍惚了许久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>别高兴得太早了，乌尔里希！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">兔毛手袋：</div><div>这还远远不够填上你浪费的非对称核素R的缺口——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它对兔毛手袋的发言置若罔闻，目光炽烈地盯着希曼手中的信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>基金会的条件是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>他们必须得到第一手的实验结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>可怜的桌子发出了今天的倒数第二声哀嚎。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>成交！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>随便谁——别忘了做会议记录！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌尔里希重重挥拳，玻璃缸中的磁流体翻起一阵波浪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>另外，信件上提到了一个特殊的坐标，他们无法确认该坐标的具体情况……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>那是……一艘船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>考虑到可能的风险，基金会方建议你亲自前往调查。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">希曼：</div><div>关于它的详细内容，你可以联系司辰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302513.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302513.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/78/HeadIconSmall-302513.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302513.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>好吧，乌尔里希组长，我接受你的解释了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\"><img alt=\"2_4_bg_youlun_ye1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_bg_youlun_ye1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑瞧了瞧维尔汀，又望了望正在坦然脱下伪装的乌尔里希。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>所以你并不打算带着我的“小东西”偷渡出港，而是为了实验？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>当然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>也不打算榨干你可怜组员的钱包给自己补票？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌尔里希轻咳了两声，将话题掰回了正轨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>基金会的情报相当准确，经过初步检测，这儿确实是个符合实验条件的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>除了“暴雨”的时候，非对称核素R检测仪的读数可从来没有这么激烈过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>慢着，乌尔里希组长！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>你会抱着那些材料到海里去游泳吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>如有必要的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……喂！我抗——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抢在星锑发出新的宣言之前，一张熟悉的唱片猝不及防地映在了墨镜的倒影中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515613.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-515613.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515613.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515613.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-515613.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515613.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8b/HeadIconSmall-515613.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515613.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>它该物归原主了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一人一唱片亲昵地搂抱在一起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302512.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302512.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-302512.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302512.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>我的宝贝儿唱片，欢迎回家！——我保证我会在APPLe电台连续播放72小时，为你举办最最最盛大的回归派对！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>重逢的喜悦终于在接连不断的热泪与耳鬓厮磨中宣泄完毕，一个更严峻的可能性闪过星锑的脑海。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>等等，你该不会打算现在收回对我的一切资助吧——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>你误会了，星锑研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>考虑到这张唱片本身对于你的特殊意义……我们将对它的“采样与成分分析”工作列入了第一优先级，目前这项工作已经完成了，它当然应该物归原主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>可，你的实验还没有结束……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>星锑抚摸着手中的“小东西”，咬了咬牙，又忍痛将它递给了乌尔里希。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>组长轻咳了两声，又故作正式地重新披上了“伪装”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"515601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"515601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/51/HeadIconSmall-515601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-515601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>别担心，我早有准备。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_cangdie\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_cangdie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它得意洋洋地扬起风衣，展示拉普拉斯最新的杰作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>数十张一模一样的“小东西”唱片叠成了一摞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>为了实验结果的一致性，我们甚至以同样的书写材料与笔迹模拟了上面的乐队签名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>这些材料是拉普拉斯工艺的结晶。音场的空间感与细节表现、唱片本身使用的乙烯基材料，甚至是中间的装饰水晶，我们都做到了结构与表现的完全一致。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>组长自豪的语气与星锑惊讶的疾呼声交织在一起。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_lingluan2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_lingluan2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_lingluan2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-2_4_at_lingluan2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_lingluan2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"588\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bb/Cg-2_4_at_lingluan2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_lingluan2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/bb/Cg-2_4_at_lingluan2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"988\" data-file-height=\"968\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>什么——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>尽管我完全认可拉普拉斯科算中心的科研素质与实验态度——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_xingti1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_xingti1\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_xingti1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-2_4_at_xingti1.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_xingti1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-2_4_at_xingti1.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_xingti1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Cg-2_4_at_xingti1.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_xingti1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">星锑：</div><div>……但这并不代表我支持你的盗印行为啊！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_4_at_cangdie\"><img alt=\"2_4_at_cangdie\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png/600px-Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png/900px-Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8c/Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png/1200px-Cg-2_4_at_cangdie.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌尔里希：</div><div>看来你对科研使命的理解仍有不足……星锑研究员，你还有很长的路要走啊！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LEE-10"}}